{
  "_comment": [
    "MCVS Encore gamer tags: the names of the generated leaderboard rivals and of the in-match bots (docs/LIVEOPS.md section",
    "5.1 'Rival names and emblems'). Since build 29 every name comes first from the curated list (curatedFile, one name per",
    "line: puns, memes, other games' characters, brands, streamer handles, clan tags, words of many languages, written by us",
    "after reading what players really pick; the sources are listed in its header). The server picks from it by a hash of the",
    "rival's or bot slot's id; the word lists and styles below only make the names a board needs once the curated list is used",
    "up (a board of more than about 2,000 players). tools/content-gen/content_gen.py build_names checks every curated name",
    "(the characters the client shows and takes, 2..16 characters, the blocklist, no two that read alike or one letter apart), every part",
    "(charset, length, blocklist, no duplicates), every two-part combination of every style, and writes",
    "server/Content/names.json with the rivals' emblem and background pools (ids only, from Design/MCVS_Meta.xlsx).",
    "Brands, other games' and films' characters, streamers and pro players are allowed (the owner's rule since build 29).",
    "Never: slurs, hate terms and symbols, anything sexual, real tragedies, politics, religion, drugs, real private people.",
    "A word goes in adj or in noun, never both (nounNoun makes ShadowWolf)."
  ],
  "_curatedFile": "the curated names, next to this file (UTF-8, one name per line, lines starting with # are comments)",
  "curatedFile": "names_curated.txt",
  "_minCurated": "build_names fails when the curated list has fewer names than this",
  "minCurated": 1500,
  "_curatedNear": [
    "pairs of curated names allowed although their skeletons (both of 5 letters or more) are one letter apart: two different",
    "jokes, never the same joke written twice (Sheesh / Sheeesh, Scooby Snack / Scooby Snacks). build_names refuses any",
    "other such pair (they could share a board or a bot window and look like one name copied) and a pair here that is not one."
  ],
  "curatedNear": [["Master Chief", "Master Chef"], ["Rip and Tear", "Rip and Tea"], ["TrYhArD", "Fry Hard"],
                  ["MrBeast", "Mr Feast"], ["Rayman", "DayMan"]],
  "version": 2,
  "_limits": "the game's own rename popup takes 16 characters (popups/PopupChangeName.as maxChars) and needs 2 (PlayerProfileComponent MinimalPlayerNameLength); the default name agent-<9 digits> has 15",
  "limits": {"min": 3, "max": 16},
  "_years": "the {year} token",
  "years": [1990, 2012],
  "_minCombinations": "build_names fails when the styles give fewer distinct names than this (word parts only, digits not counted)",
  "minCombinations": 50000,
  "_defaultShare": "per cent of rivals that keep the starting emblem and background (StartingKillSignature Avatar=1, Background=1), as an uncustomised player does",
  "defaultShare": 8,
  "_roughNouns": [
    "parts.mascot is the only word list a style may put next to a country code ({country}): animals, sky and landscape words.",
